00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.200 align:start position:0%
this morning we're also learning new  details about a deadly plane crash in  Istanbul Turkey video shows the flight  landing in wet weather then disappearing  into a ditch  passengers scrambled to safety through a  gaping crack in the fuselage Roxana  Saberi has more the plane snapped into  three pieces after skidding off a wet  runway and dropping into a ditch the  impact of the crash was so strong the  front of the fuselage even flipped  upside down still most of the 183  passengers and crew on board managed to  survive some passengers helped one  another escape through a crack before  several of the injured were taken away  on a bus with no first responders in  sight this passenger says he was seated  in row 25 and the plane broke apart in  row 26 he says even though he was hurt  he guided other passengers to safety  security camera footage shows the planes  hard landing in the rain Istanbul  governor says the bad weather caused the  aircraft to slide off the runway this is  a third time a Boeing 737 flight run by  Turkey's Pegasus Airlines has skidded  off a runway in the past two years last  month at the same Istanbul Airport and  in 2018 a passenger plane came to a stop  just feet from the Black Sea in those  two incidents no one was injured for CBS  this morning Roxana Saberi London
 

